  "recordType": "rule-section",
  "ruleText": "Fam 301.14 “New Hampshire Conflict Resolution Association” means a private non-profit organization with a membership interested in the practice and public understanding of peaceable conflict resolution, formerly known as New Hampshire Mediation Association.\n\nSource. #8719, eff 11-1-06; ss by #8930, eff 7-4-07; ss by #9674, eff 4-2-10; ss by #12507, INTERIM, eff 4-2-18, EXPIRED: 10-1-18\n\nNew. #12634, eff 10-2-18 (formerly Fam 301.13)",
